# Agatha's Soul Cauldron: "You may spend mana as though it were mana of any color to activate abilities of creatures you
# control" (CR 609.4b) - creatures only. Turn 3, Mox Sapphire's {U} is floating: Pyrite Spellbomb's "{R}, Sacrifice this
# artifact" cannot use it (the engine asks for more mana, Mountain pays, and the {U} is still in the pool), but Blazing
# Rootwalla's "{R}: +2/+0" is then paid with that same {U}, leaving Mox Ruby untapped: the untapped Mox Ruby, which could
# pay it too, shows the {U} was spent rather than the {R}. (That the pump is offered when only the {U} could pay it is
# agathas-soul-cauldron-offers-a-creature-ability-payable-only-with-another-color.)

